loom grades allowances=A+ witness=A+ scan=A+ control=A+
file caravan/allowances.rye the seven bounds, four chosen and three recomputed from their sources, with the finding asserted
file tools/fixtures/caravan_allowance_symbol_scan.sh names and values read from the header, derived values resolved from the source it names
file tools/fixtures/caravan_allowance_widen_control.sh the invariant proven load-bearing, welcome before refusal, in a pen inside the tree
file tools/ca/caravan_allowances_witness.rish four RED paths and the widen control, GREEN on metal
file caravan/LADDER.md the row the roster guard asked for, beside objects
file construction/ITINERARY.md Now refilled with the rung; one lap row shelved
recommend keep-going the fourth microkernel rung is the address space -- objects.rye names four mapping objects as one debt wearing four sizes and allowances.rye now names the cspace that holds them, so the next rung states what a protection domain's address space is made of and which Caravan module owes each part; measure regions.rye and mapping.rye against Microkit's memory-region vocabulary first, and let the accounting decide whether there is a finding or only a transcription
